{"seq":3,"slug":"lc0025-reverse-nodes-in-k-group","title":"LeetCode 25 K 个一组翻转链表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-comprehensive/lc0025-reverse-nodes-in-k-group","wordCount":897,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-25-k-个一组翻转链表\">LeetCode 25 K 个一组翻转链表</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定链表的头节点 <code>head</code>，每 k 个节点一组进行翻转，返回修改后的链表。k 是一个正整数，其值小于或等于链表的长度。如果节点总数不是 k 的整数倍，最后剩余的节点保持原有顺序。</p>\n<p>不能改变节点内部的值，只能进行节点本身的交换。</p>\n<p><strong>示例：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：head = [1,2,3,4,5], k = 2&#10;输出：[2,1,4,3,5]&#10;&#10;输入：head = [1,2,3,4,5], k = 3&#10;输出：[3,2,1,4,5]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：head = [1,2,3,4,5], k = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[2,1,4,3,5]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输入：head = [1,2,3,4,5], k = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[3,2,1,4,5]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>链表中节点的数目为 <code>n</code></li>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= k &lt;= n &lt;= 5000</code></li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 1000</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题是链表翻转的进阶版本。基本的链表翻转只需要反转整个链表，而本题需要分段翻转，并正确连接各段。</p>\n<p><strong>解题步骤分解：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>计数</strong>：先检查剩余节点是否足够 k 个。不足 k 个则保持原样。</li>\n<li><strong>翻转</strong>：对当前 k 个节点执行标准链表翻转。</li>\n<li><strong>连接</strong>：将翻转后的子链表与前一段的尾部和后一段的头部正确连接。</li>\n<li><strong>递进</strong>：移动到下一组，重复以上步骤。</li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>递归</td>\n<td>翻转当前 k 个节点，递归处理剩余部分</td>\n<td>代码简洁，逻辑清晰</td>\n<td>递归栈深度 O(n/k)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代</td>\n<td>使用指针逐组翻转</td>\n<td>常数空间</td>\n<td>指针操作较复杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>指针关系的核心理解：</strong> 翻转一组 k 个节点后，这组的第一个节点变成了最后一个（tail），最后一个变成了第一个（new head）。因此需要：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>前一组的 tail 指向当前组翻转后的 new head</li>\n<li>当前组翻转后的 tail 指向下一组的 head</li>\n</ul>\n<p>使用 dummy 节点避免对第一组的特殊处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"迭代方法\">迭代方法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ListNode {&#10;  val: number;&#10;  next: ListNode | null;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function reverseKGroup(head: ListNode | null, k: number): ListNode | null {&#10;  const dummy: ListNode = { val: 0, next: head };&#10;  let prevGroupTail: ListNode = dummy;&#10;&#10;  while (true) {&#10;    const groupStart = prevGroupTail.next;&#10;&#10;    let check: ListNode | null = groupStart;&#10;    for (let i = 0; i &lt; k; i++) {&#10;      if (check === null) return dummy.next;&#10;      check = check.next;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    const [newHead, newTail] = reverseLinkedList(groupStart!, k);&#10;&#10;    prevGroupTail.next = newHead;&#10;    newTail.next = check;&#10;&#10;    prevGroupTail = newTail;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;function reverseLinkedList(head: ListNode, count: number): [ListNode, ListNode] {&#10;  let prev: ListNode | null = null;&#10;  let curr: ListNode | null = head;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; count; i++) {&#10;    const next = curr!.next;&#10;    curr!.next = prev;&#10;    prev = curr;&#10;    curr = next;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return [prev!, head];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reverseKGroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">head</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dummy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { val: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, next: head };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prevGroupTail</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dummy;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> groupStart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prevGroupTail.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> check</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> groupStart;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"